      "writtenOn": "2024-06-11T13:35:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm. It\u0027s possible we might add non-const operations to the raw AVmAttestationResult in the future. I\u0027d rather not guarantee `Sync` since we\u0027d then have to introduce explicit synchronization to maintain the trait. We don\u0027t have a need for it so far, and adding it in the future would be easier than removing it.\n\nI\u0027ve modified my safety comment, since the immutability is irrelevant to `Send`.",
