      "writtenOn": "2024-06-12T10:08:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Definitely not.\n\nThe \u0026self comes from a const pointer in the C API, which is translated back to \u0026AttestationResult in the Rust implementation, so the type system should prevent us from achieving that even if we wanted to.",
